    "head_branch": "feature/benches-in-the-crate",
    "head_commit_message": "feat(native): tick_phases timed on the crate's tick (spec 39 step 8c-xviii)\n\nbreach_tick_phases brings tick_phases.gd's battle to its fight in the crate and\ntimes the crate's own tick pass by pass: each pass ends a lap (src/laps.rs),\ncounted only while the bench times it. Printed as tick_phases.gd prints it, so\nthe bench workflow runs it (tool=breach_tick_phases) and bench_compare.py reads\nit. The set-ups are held to Godot's tick and event counts by a cargo test.\n8c-xviii is split further: rout_bench and native_bench's columns are 8c-xix,\nspec 38 step 2's series, terrain=mixed and counts 8c-xx.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi1syjMvBE1GZmEPgGf",
